# Shopkeeper Mobile Application Implementation Plan

This document outlines the implementation plan for the Shopkeeper Mobile Application based on the requirements and architecture defined in the `SHOPKEEPER_MOBILE_README.md` file.

## Goal Description

The goal is to create the frontend mobile application for authorized shopkeepers to interact with the Medicine Authenticity and Anti-Counterfeit System. The app will allow shopkeepers to login via Google (using Firebase), scan medicine QR codes, receive/sell/return medicines, and view transactions and alerts. The application will be a "thin client" meaning it does not make security decisions; all authorization and authenticity verifications are done by the backend.

